  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of Humanitarian Hygiene Promotion Assistance to South Sudanese in Al Waral Camp</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Interventions in this programme document are designed to respond to the humanitarian hygiene needs in this new camp. Activities include Participatory Hygiene Sanitation Transformation (PHAST); Raise awareness on personal, environmental and household hygiene through daily home visits, radio and Interpersonal communication, community dialogue, drama/theater performances, hand washing promotion, water point support /household and jerry can cleaning demonstrations; Conduct hygiene promotion message dissemination and campaigns; establishment of WASH Committees to follow up the hygiene promotion work alongside community leaders and the hygiene promoters on daily basis</narrative>
  </description>
